  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 20th level, the warpmaster gains 1 euclidean point for every 5 feet of movement. In addition, the total maximum number of euclidean points he can hold at any given time is now equal to 5 x his warpmaster level + his Intelligence modifier (a 20th level warpmaster with a +4 Intelligence modifier would have 104). Finally, the warpmaster gains a +4 bonus on any rolls to confirm critical hits with his nth-blade. This stacks with other bonuses to confirmation rolls.</p>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/warpmaster#toc38\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
